    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "I'm glad to hear it. I'm glad to hear it. And so Scott, do you want to just give us your reflections on the on the state of the race at the moment? It's been a bit of a wild, wild year. It's really pretty difficult to see the guy",
